{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.Gen1QuarkRays","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Gen1QuarkRays","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.BringConeGauge","lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.ChiralityGradingConstruction"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.constSeed_collapses_flavour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.constSeed_collapses_flavour","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L154-L159","doc":"**And it does not separate flavour**: `uL` and `dL` go to the same vector. So the\n`u`/`d` assignment is not determined by the grading, the flip, or the Reeb triad; it is\nan input (the `seed`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.constSeed_eigen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.constSeed_eigen","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L148-L152","doc":"It satisfies the seed hypothesis at `u = i`: `Γ_i 1 = i·1·i = −1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.constSeed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.constSeed","kind":"def","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L145-L146","doc":"The constant seed `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.reebM_k_not_chirality_preserving","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.reebM_k_not_chirality_preserving","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L134-L141","doc":"The same for `M_k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.reebM_j_not_chirality_preserving","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.reebM_j_not_chirality_preserving","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L124-L132","doc":"**`M_j` cannot realise a chirality-preserving label map.** Applied to a `Γ_u = −1`\nvector, it gives a `Γ_u = −1` vector only if the result is 2-torsion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_unique","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L112-L122","doc":"**The right-handed images are forced.** A map that sends each left-handed label's\npartner to `M_j` of its image equals `gen1Ray` of itself: only the four left-handed\nvalues are free. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_flip","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L97-L110","doc":"**`flipChirality` becomes `M_j` up to the sign `±1`** (`+1` from left to right, `−1`\nfrom right to left). This is the ray-level form `no_vector_equivariant_map` allows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_gamma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_gamma","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L82-L95","doc":"**Chirality goes to the eigenvalue of `Γ_u`**: left-handed to `−1`, right-handed to\n`+1`, provided the seed puts the left-handed labels in the `Γ_u = −1` eigenspace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_right","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L78-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray_left","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L74-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.gen1Ray","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L69-L72","doc":"The map built from images of the left-handed labels: a left-handed label goes to\nits `seed`, a right-handed one to `M_j` of its left partner's `seed`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.no_vector_equivariant_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.Chirality.no_vector_equivariant_map","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/Gen1QuarkRays.lean#L57-L67","doc":"**No vector-level equivariance.** If `φ (flipChirality x) = M_j (φ x)` for every\nlabel, every image is 2-torsion: `flipChirality² = id` but `M_j² = −id`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}